~ OSRAM OSLON Black SFH 4715A, a 850 nm infrared emitter [@Osram-SFH4715A]. Values are typical, at 1 A and a 10 ms pulse unless noted.

design led

lam = 860 :nm

    ~ Peak wavelength. The centroid wavelength is 850 nm, section Characteristics.

Forward voltage: V_f = 1.65 | 2.1 :V

    ~ Typical and maximum, section Characteristics.

Forward current: I_f = 1 :A

    ~ Test condition for the radiant flux and forward voltage below, and the maximum DC rating.

Phi = 785 :mW

    ~ Total radiant flux, typical, section Characteristics.

eta = Phi / (V_f * I_f)

    ~ Optical power out over electrical power in, from the values above. Not published as a figure.

theta = 45 :deg

    ~ Half angle, typical, section Characteristics.

m = 32 :mg

    ~ Approximate, package outline.
